cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Electrification Suite: Interactive Models of Chemical Process Electrification"
authors:
  - family-names: Kwak
    given-names: Yeonsu
    affiliation: "Vlachos Lab, University of Delaware"
    email: ask.yeonsu@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/robin-yk/Electrification-Suite"
url: "https://robin-yk.github.io/Electrification-Suite/"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based interactive models of chemical process electrification:
  a 2D microwave-heating powder-bed temperature model with dielectric
  response and experimental calibration, a 2D Joule-heating model
  with nonlinear thermal solving, and a dimensionless
  visualizer of ramped-vs-continuous (RPH vs CJH) Joule heating and its
  Jensen's-inequality effects on temperature-dependent kinetics and
  transport. All calculations run client-side with no backend.
keywords:
  - chemical engineering
  - process electrification
  - catalysis
  - microwave heating
  - joule heating
  - reactor engineering
  - dimensionless analysis
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-08"
